@EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5244

### Login as Viewer (the HTTP client stores the returned cookie)
POST {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "viewer",
  "password": "viewer123"
}

### Viewer can read employees
GET {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Accept: application/json

### Viewer receives 403 for an Admin-only operation
DELETE {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employee/1

### Login as Admin (replaces the current authentication cookie)
POST {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Admin can add an employee
POST {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thandi",
  "lastName": "Ndlovu",
  "email": "thandi.ndlovu@example.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "gender": 2,
  "mobileNumber": "0821234567"
}

### Show the current authenticated user
GET {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Clear the authentication cookie
POST {{EmployeeDirectory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
